17592186143196 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186143197 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186424808 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186424831 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426008 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186510387 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1039 "Multiplying a Fraction by a Whole Number Resulting in a Mixed Number" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186142513 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142775 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "91037b32-189a-5ba9-ab0a-117f6255c496" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186143632 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186143633 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186143634 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186143635 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186143636 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1045 "Multiplying Fractions by Whole Numbers" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186143632 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186050599 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186142997 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "78db3c1b-5958-5d06-912e-feba2d0d67f3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143194 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186140356 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143194 #edb/ref 1069 "q-186845" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143194 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143194 #edb/ref 1071 "Expressed as a whole number, $\\frac{1}{2}\\times 2=${{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143194 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0fd772d2-d88c-5889-b52a-bb0aa20863cb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143194 #edb/ref 1074 "To multiply a fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's numerator by the whole number and keep the denominator the same:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1\\times 2}{2}=\\frac{2}{2}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify:\n\n$$\n2÷2=1\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143632 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186143633 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143632 #edb/ref 1061 130656 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143632 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ec9e5f6f-5761-5bfe-a807-c02ebc68c07b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143632 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186144029 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143633 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186143634 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143633 #edb/ref 1061 130657 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143633 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0650c7dd-3214-5c51-8afb-c59493c3db45" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143633 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186142772 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143634 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186143635 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143634 #edb/ref 1061 130661 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143634 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4e5e79ca-ec3a-5392-9974-2808857187dd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143634 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186142773 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143635 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186143636 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143635 #edb/ref 1061 130665 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143635 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "21db46b2-cb05-59f7-946c-993b805b99a2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143635 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186142774 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143636 #edb/ref 1061 130669 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143636 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "130fe104-c8f0-562f-9d3d-edb7b1985250" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186143636 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186142775 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186144029 #edb/ref 1064 "We can use models to multiply fractions by whole numbers. But can we do this without using models?\n\nAs it turns out, models give us vital clues on how this should be done!\n\nTo demonstrate, let's take a look at the fraction model for $\\dfrac 2 9 \\times 3\\mathbin{:}$\n\n![](images/47/4700c7ddbdc849a73d69ba41d2d716218f1fb181e8e5e9b8757392db6d9a6243.png)\n\nIn the answer, we end up with ${\\color{blue}{2}}\\times {\\color{red}{3}} = 6$ parts, and the denominator remains the same. This is always the case. \n\nTherefore, to multiply a fraction by a whole number, we follow the following steps:\n\n**Step 1**: We multiply the numerator by the whole number.\n\n**Step 2**: We keep the denominator the same.\n\nUsing these steps, we can figure out the answer without using models:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\color{blue}2}{9}{\\color{red}\\,\\times 3\\,} = \\dfrac{{\\color{blue}{2}}{\\color{red}\\,\\times 3\\,}}{9} =  \\dfrac{6}{9}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186144029 #edb/ref 1065 8393 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186144029 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "e1ad38dc-1875-52f8-ad8b-fb013451e541" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186144029 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048624 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147851 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147852 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426686 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426690 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426692 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426698 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426701 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1039 "Expressing Multiplication of Fractions by Whole Numbers as Multiplication and Division" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186147140 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147457 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "0b508e1a-00f5-58d1-b399-344884761c8e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147853 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147867 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426684 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426685 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426687 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426691 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1039 "Expressing Multiplication and Division as Multiplication of Fractions by Whole Numbers" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186147141 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147458 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "fdcb850d-14d5-56e9-81d8-9af497460503" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147849 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147896 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426688 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426689 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426693 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426697 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186426699 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186510420 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1039 "Swapping the Multiplier and the Numerator of a Fraction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186147142 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147459 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "dfdc6b8f-e329-57b4-9ae9-e2f2c92105be" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147460 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050742 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147460 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147865 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147460 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186147868 #edb/ref 17592186